{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0129LN5uKnzWGUSK44EQYHSi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KX36gybDGrt8iEU7shjpWf","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"recovery_aware_struct_prune","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15713,"cache_read_input_tokens":17145,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":15713,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014vLHgt2xRFWF1UkYk4SRSq","session_id":"338b77c3-ab77-4d20-989d-1a060abc37a8","uuid":"bd5df699-8b75-47c2-99df-cf941b317e0d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KX36gybDGrt8iEU7shjpWf","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: D022 — Calibration sensitivity at 20% sparsity (fragile threshold)\\\\n- [关键发现] westb (512 calibration samples) 和 westd (256 samples) 代码完全一致（0 行 diff），但 α=0.0 结果分别为 1% 和 30%。根因：calibration sample 数量差异导致 ~5% MLP group 选择不同。模型在 20% sparsity 处于 fragile threshold，少量 group 变化引起巨大 accuracy 差异。\\\\n- [验证] westb Standard 1% 是真实退化（输出 \\\\\\\"10 years, 10 years...\\\\\\\" 重复循环 316KB），不是 eval bug。同服务器、同脚本、间隔 45 分钟，RASP 输出连贯推理（91KB）。\\\\n- [α ablation N=100] α=0.0 (30%) / α=0.5 (25%) / α=1.0 (27%) — 95% CI 重叠，无统计显著差异。需要 N=1319 全集才能下结论。\\\\n- [行动项] westd 需用 n_samples=512 重算 importance scores 消除 calibration 混淆。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: GRPO sampling collapse on pruned models\\\\n- [失败模式] SFT 恢复 greedy 准确率 (57-64%) 和 EOS (99%) 后，GRPO sampling (temp=0.7) 仍导致剪枝模型退化为重复循环，grad_norm=0, reward=0。根因：剪枝模型在 stochastic sampling 下脆弱。\\\\n- [v2 失败] beta=0 + max_completion_length=1024, 双组 step 30-35 collapse → GRPO method failure。\\\\n- [v3 失败] beta=0.01 触发 GRPOTrainer from_pretrained 加载 ref_model，剪枝模型 shape mismatch 崩溃。\\\\n- [v4 修复] monkey-patch create_model_from_path → load_pruned_model。temp 0.7→0.4, repetition_penalty=1.15, format_reward +0.1, gradient_checkpointing=True, max_completion_length=2048。TRL 1.1.0。\\\\n- [经验] GRPO 在剪枝模型上必须预检 sampling 生成质量。beta>0 需要手动处理 ref_model 加载。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: GraSP vs RASP — gradient saliency 远劣于 CKA-aware pruning\\\\n- [关键发现] GraSP 20% post-prune accuracy = 8% (50 样本 checkpoint)，RASP 20% = 29-31%，3.6x 差距。\\\\n- GraSP 模型 EOS rate 仅 2%（几乎所有输出截断在 4096 token），说明 gradient-based saliency 在结构化剪枝中严重破坏生成能力。\\\\n- 使用 GRASPrune 库，keep_ratio=0.80, rescale_alpha=0.5, 512 samples, 4 epochs gate training。\\\\n- 模型路径: `/root/autodl-tmp/recovery_aware_struct_prune/pruned_graspune_20/`\\\\n- [意义] 有力回应 Dream reviewer concern (plan_005)——RASP 显著优于主流 gradient-based baseline。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: α ablation SFT — 非单调关系确认\\\\n- α=4.0: post-prune 40% → post-SFT 62% (+22pp)，为所有 α 值中最高\\\\n- α=1.0 (RASP default): post-prune 29% → post-SFT 57%\\\\n- Standard: post-prune 27% → post-SFT 64%\\\\n- [观察] post-prune 阶段 α=4.0 最优，但 post-SFT 阶段差距缩小（57-64% 范围）。SFT 有均衡化效应。\\\\n- [关键问题] GRPO 阶段是否能拉开差距？这是整个论文 narrative 的决定性验证。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: sft_standard_20 checkpoint 已删除\\\\n- 磁盘清理删除了 sft_standard_20（81GB），正在 cuda:1 重训。\\\\n- 重训参数：pruned_standard_20 + GSM8K full train (7473) + 2 epochs + lr=2e-5，~37-40 min。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: 代码与环境备忘\\\\n- α ablation: `prune.py` 支持 `--alpha`，CKA 分数缓存 `results/cka_scores.pt`\\\\n- Full eval: `scripts/run_full_eval.sh`（新版），`src/run_full_eval.sh`（旧版）\\\\n- GRASPrune: `/root/GRASPrune/`，不要 `pip install -r requirements.txt`\\\\n- GRPO 输出路径：`grpo_stage2_rasp_20` / `grpo_stage2_standard_20`\\\\n- sft_recovery.py 不支持 `--save_strategy` 和 `--overwrite_output_dir` 参数\\\\n- westb 磁盘：数据盘 250GB 已用 141GB，剩 110GB\\\\n- westd 磁盘：释放 93GB 后空间充足（原 72GB used → 大幅改善）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2685, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014vLHgt2xRFWF1UkYk4SRSq","session_id":"338b77c3-ab77-4d20-989d-1a060abc37a8","uuid":"60b816d8-7dfe-4786-b660-f854f53a573b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T15:06:48.787Z"}
