{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QbW1kJ52U5Eb8bS5Tgv7c2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Pivot到\"Pruning-Recovery Interaction\"：核心贡献从\"RASP enables recovery\"转为\n2\t  \"pruning method和recovery method之间存在非trivial交互——RLVR和SFT对pruned结构的需求不同\"。 Claim 1弱化为\"CKA-aware\n3\t  pruning在GRPO recovery下有中等优势\"； Claim 2保留但降低强度（\"CKA provides additional predictive\n4\t  signal\"而非\"stronger predictor\"）； Claim 3成为最强claim——SFT倾向Standard、GRPO倾向RASP的交叉效应是genuinely\n5\t  novel发现。 α优化作为second practical contribution。需要30% sparsity数据展示趋势。 竞争力：EMNLP Main有竞争力但需要强writing，Findings高概率。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: Full GSM8K Eval N=1319 (Post-Prune)\n10\t  plan_id: plan_001\n11\t  description: '对baseline dense模型、RASP_20、Standard_20在完整GSM8K test set (1319 samples)上评估。\n12\t    替代现有N=100的初步数据，获得±2.4pp的tight CI。\n13\t\n14\t    '\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    baseline_dense_gsm8k_1319: 0.79\n17\t    rasp_20_gsm8k_1319: 0.3\n18\t    standard_20_gsm8k_1319: 0.27\n19\t    rasp_vs_standard_gap_pp: 3\n20\t    rasp_ci_95:\n21\t    - 0.276\n22\t    - 0.324\n23\t    standard_ci_95:\n24\t    - 0.246\n25\t    - 0.294\n26\t    gap_p_value_single_seed: 0.11\n27\t  result_rationale: 'N=100的reeval_postprune_definitive已显示gap为4pp (31% vs 27% on westb)。\n28\t    扩展到N=1319后，点估计会regress toward mean——N=100的方差大(±9pp CI)， full eval预期RASP 30%、Standard\n29\t    27%左右。单seed下CI重叠，p≈0.11不显著， 这正是median档的核心特征：gap真实存在但需要multi-seed才能确认显著性。 Dense\n30\t    baseline 79%与DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B已知性能一致。\n31\t\n32\t    '\n33\t  tables:\n34\t  - name: 'Table 1: Post-Prune GSM8K Accuracy (N=1319)'\n35\t    columns:\n36\t    - Model\n37\t    - Accuracy\n38\t    - 95% CI\n39\t    - vs Dense Δ\n40\t    rows:\n41\t    - - Dense Baseline\n42\t      - 79.0%\n43\t      - '[76.8, 81.2]'\n44\t      - —\n45\t    - - RASP_20\n46\t      - 30.0%\n47\t      - '[27.6, 32.4]'\n48\t      - -49.0pp\n49\t    - - Standard_20\n50\t      - 27.0%\n51\t      - '[24.6, 29.4]'\n52\t      - -52.0pp\n53\t  figures_description:\n54\t  - Bar chart showing post-prune accuracy for 3 models with error bars (95% CI). Gap\n55\t    between RASP and Standard visible but CI overlap.\n56\t  analysis: '3pp gap在N=1319下仍不够statistically significant (单seed)。 这确认了median档预期：需要multi-seed\n57\t    (plan_006)来建立significance。 Post-prune gap本身不是headline claim——recovery后的gap才是。\n58\t\n59\t    '\n60\t- name: Full GSM8K Eval N=1319 (Post-Recovery)\n61\t  plan_id: plan_004\n62\t  description: '对所有recovered模型(SFT→GRPO)在完整GSM8K test set上评估。 Paper Table 1的最终数字。\n63\t\n64\t    '\n65\t  expected_results:\n66\t    post_grpo_rasp_gsm8k_1319: 0.64\n67\t    post_grpo_standard_gsm8k_1319: 0.59\n68\t    post_sft_rasp_gsm8k_1319: 0.56\n69\t    post_sft_standard_gsm8k_1319: 0.64\n70\t    grpo_recovery_gap_pp: 5\n71\t    grpo_rasp_recovery_from_postprune_pp: 34\n72\t    grpo_standard_recovery_from_postprune_pp: 32\n73\t    grpo_rasp_vs_dense_retention: 0.81\n74\t    grpo_standard_vs_dense_retention: 0.75\n75\t  result_rationale: 'Median档定义GRPO recovery gap为2-8pp。取中值5pp：RASP 64%、Standard 59%。\n76\t    两者都从post-prune状态大幅恢复（+34pp和+32pp），说明GRPO对两种pruned结构 都有效——但RASP保留的functionally\n77\t    unique结构给GRPO多提供了5pp的恢复空间。 SFT-only数据(plan_009)会反转这个关系，构成交互效应的核心证据。 Recovery gap有限但在N=1319下CI不重叠（64%±2.6\n78\t    vs 59%±2.7）， 可达p<0.05显著性。\n79\t\n80\t    '\n81\t  tables:\n82\t  - name: 'Table 1: Full Pipeline Results (N=1319)'\n83\t    columns:\n84\t    - Model\n85\t    - Post-Prune\n86\t    - Post-SFT\n87\t    - Post-GRPO\n88\t    - Recovery Δ\n89\t    rows:\n90\t    - - Dense\n91\t      - 79.0%\n92\t      - —\n93\t      - —\n94\t      - —\n95\t    - - RASP_20\n96\t      - 30.0%\n97\t      - 56.0%\n98\t      - 64.0%\n99\t      - +34.0pp\n100\t    - - Standard_20\n101\t      - 27.0%\n102\t      - 64.0%\n103\t      - 59.0%\n104\t      - +32.0pp\n105\t  figures_description:\n106\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: post-prune → post-SFT → post-GRPO for RASP and Standard. 显示SFT阶段Standard更高，GRPO阶段RASP反超——交叉效应可视化。'\n107\t  analysis: '关键发现：SFT阶段Standard领先8pp (64% vs 56%)，GRPO阶段RASP反超5pp (64% vs 59%)。 这个crossover是Claim\n108\t    3的核心证据。GRPO gap 5pp虽然modest，但方向一致且N=1319下 statistically significant。Narrative\n109\t    pivot到\"pruning-recovery interaction\"合理。\n110\t\n111\t    '\n112\t- name: GRASPrune Baseline 20% Sparsity\n113\t  plan_id: plan_005\n114\t  description: 'GRASPrune (ACL 2026 SOTA) 在20% sparsity下的完整pipeline： prune → eval\n115\t    → SFT → GRPO recovery。Primary external baseline。\n116\t\n117\t    '\n118\t  expected_results:\n119\t    grasp_20_postprune_gsm8k_1319: 0.08\n120\t    grasp_20_postprune_eos_rate: 0.05\n121\t    grasp_20_post_sft_gsm8k_1319: 0.42\n122\t    grasp_20_post_grpo_gsm8k_1319: 0.52\n123\t    grasp_sft_recovery_pp: 34\n124\t    grasp_grpo_recovery_from_sft_pp: 10\n125\t    grasp_vs_rasp_grpo_gap_pp: 12\n126\t  result_rationale: '已有初步数据：grasp_baseline_westd显示50-sample post-prune accuracy仅8%，\n127\t    EOS rate 2%，avg_len 4019——与Standard_20的initial状态类似（generation崩溃）。 Median档预期GRASPrune\n128\t    post-prune远差于RASP (8% vs 31%)因为GRASPrune 优化budgeted importance但不考虑functional redundancy，会移除functionally\n129\t    unique的结构。SFT恢复到42%（从8%有大幅提升，说明结构本身没有完全损坏， 只是generation能力崩溃）。GRPO进一步恢复到52%，但仍低于RASP的64%。\n130\t    关键：GRASPrune+GRPO (52%) vs Standard+GRPO (59%)的gap说明 pruning method确实影响recovery\n131\t    ceiling，且GRASPrune的\"better importance scoring\" 不能弥补missing CKA signal。但GRASPrune+GRPO也在恢复（不是完全fail），\n132\t    这符合median档\"GRPO broadly effective\"的假设。\n133\t\n134\t    '\n135\t  tables:\n136\t  - name: 'Table 2: GRASPrune vs RASP vs Standard Pipeline'\n137\t    columns:\n138\t    - Method\n139\t    - Post-Prune\n140\t    - Post-SFT\n141\t    - Post-GRPO\n142\t    rows:\n143\t    - - RASP_20\n144\t      - 30.0%\n145\t      - 56.0%\n146\t      - 64.0%\n147\t    - - Standard_20\n148\t      - 27.0%\n149\t      - 64.0%\n150\t      - 59.0%\n151\t    - - GRASPrune_20\n152\t      - 8.0%\n153\t      - 42.0%\n154\t      - 52.0%\n155\t  figures_description:\n156\t  - 三组柱状图对比三种pruning方法的pipeline轨迹。GRASPrune post-prune最差但GRPO recovery可观——说明recovery能力不完全由post-prune\n157\t    accuracy决定。\n158\t  analysis: 'GRASPrune作为baseline提供两个关键insight：(1) post-prune accuracy不能直接预测 recovery\n159\t    ceiling（GRASPrune 8%→52%，恢复44pp；RASP 30%→64%，恢复34pp）， 说明recovery mechanism非线性。(2)\n160\t    即使是SOTA importance-based pruning， 不考虑CKA信号也会移除GRPO-critical结构。 但median档下这个narrative需要nuance：Standard\n161\t    (27%→59%) recovery也不错， 说明CKA signal的贡献是incremental而非decisive。\n162\t\n163\t    '\n164\t- name: Multi-Seed Post-Prune Eval (5 Seeds)\n165\t  plan_id: plan_006\n166\t  description: 'RASP_20 + Standard_20在5个random seeds下的post-prune GSM8K eval。 建立robust方差估计和pairwise\n167\t    significance。\n168\t\n169\t    '\n170\t  expected_results:\n171\t    rasp_20_seed_results:\n172\t    - 0.3\n173\t    - 0.28\n174\t    - 0.31\n175\t    - 0.29\n176\t    - 0.32\n177\t    standard_20_seed_results:\n178\t    - 0.27\n179\t    - 0.29\n180\t    - 0.26\n181\t    - 0.28\n182\t    - 0.25\n183\t    rasp_20_mean: 0.3\n184\t    rasp_20_std: 0.015\n185\t    standard_20_mean: 0.27\n186\t    standard_20_std: 0.016\n187\t    gap_mean_pp: 3.0\n188\t    gap_p_value_paired_t: 0.03\n189\t    gap_p_value_wilcoxon: 0.06\n190\t    seeds_with_gap_lt_2pp: 1\n191\t  result_rationale: 'Median档定义postprune_gap_p_value_5seed为[0.01, 0.08]。取p=0.03 (paired\n192\t    t)。 5-seed方差较大：某些seed下gap缩小到<2pp（seed 2: 28% vs 29%，gap为-1pp， Standard actually高于RASP）。这正是median档\"某些seed\n193\t    gap<2pp\"的核心特征。 整体mean gap 3pp，paired t-test p=0.03达到conventional significance，\n194\t    但Wilcoxon(更conservative) p=0.06 marginal。Reviewer可以argue either way。 Std ~1.5%与GSM8K\n195\t    eval的intrinsic noise一致（N=1319下binomial std ≈ 1.3%）。\n196\t\n197\t    '\n198\t  tables:\n199\t  - name: 'Table 3: Multi-Seed Post-Prune Results'\n200\t    columns:\n201\t    - Seed\n202\t    - RASP_20\n203\t    - Standard_20\n204\t    - Gap (pp)\n205\t    rows:\n206\t    - - 42\n207\t      - 30.0%\n208\t      - 27.0%\n209\t      - '+3.0'\n210\t    - - 123\n211\t      - 28.0%\n212\t      - 29.0%\n213\t      - '-1.0'\n214\t    - - 256\n215\t      - 31.0%\n216\t      - 26.0%\n217\t      - '+5.0'\n218\t    - - 789\n219\t      - 29.0%\n220\t      - 28.0%\n221\t      - '+1.0'\n222\t    - - 1024\n223\t      - 32.0%\n224\t      - 25.0%\n225\t      - '+7.0'\n226\t    - - Mean±Std\n227\t      - 30.0±1.5%\n228\t      - 27.0±1.6%\n229\t      - '+3.0'\n230\t    - - p (paired t)\n231\t      - ''\n232\t      - ''\n233\t      - '0.03'\n234\t  figures_description:\n235\t  - Paired dot plot showing per-seed accuracy for RASP vs Standard with connecting\n236\t    lines. 一个seed交叉，其余RASP占优。\n237\t  analysis: 'Post-prune gap在统计边界：paired t p=0.03但一个seed显示反转。 这意味着Claim 1必须弱化——不能说\"significantly\n238\t    preserves more reasoning ability\"， 而应说\"tends to preserve more\"或\"preserves more\n239\t    on average across seeds\"。 但重要的是，recovery后的gap可能比post-prune gap更稳定， 因为GRPO amplifies\n240\t    structural advantages。Multi-seed GRPO recovery 数据（如果有budget做）会更有说服力。\n241\t\n242\t    '\n243\t- name: Scoring Ablation (20% Sparsity)\n244\t  plan_id: plan_007\n245\t  description: '在20% sparsity下测试不同scoring方法：magnitude-only、gradient-only、 random pruning。与RASP和Standard对比，隔离CKA的贡献。\n246\t\n247\t    '\n248\t  expected_results:\n249\t    magnitude_only_gsm8k_1319: 0.22\n250\t    gradient_only_gsm8k_1319: 0.28\n251\t    random_pruning_gsm8k_1319: 0.05\n252\t    rasp_gsm8k_1319_ref: 0.3\n253\t    standard_gsm8k_1319_ref: 0.27\n254\t    cka_marginal_contribution_vs_gradient: 2\n255\t    cka_marginal_contribution_vs_magnitude: 8\n256\t  result_rationale: 'Random pruning接近collapse (5%)——随机移除20%结构大概率命中critical components。\n257\t    Magnitude-only (22%)低于gradient-based (28%)因为weight magnitude在Qwen架构 中不是结构重要性的good\n258\t    proxy（RMSNorm使magnitude scale less informative）。 Gradient-only (28%)接近Standard\n259\t    (27%)是预期的——Standard本身就是gradient-based importance + magnitude的组合。RASP (30%)比gradient-only高2pp，\n260\t    这就是CKA的marginal contribution。Median档下这个2pp差异modest但方向正确。 关键insight：CKA的价值不在post-prune\n261\t    accuracy的marginal gain， 而在recovery-method-specific的交互效应（plan_009会显示）。\n262\t\n263\t    '\n264\t  tables:\n265\t  - name: 'Table 4: Scoring Method Ablation'\n266\t    columns:\n267\t    - Scoring\n268\t    - Post-Prune GSM8K\n269\t    - vs RASP Δ\n270\t    rows:\n271\t    - - RASP (α=1)\n272\t      - 30.0%\n273\t      - —\n274\t    - - Standard (gradient+magnitude)\n275\t      - 27.0%\n276\t      - -3.0pp\n277\t    - - Gradient-only\n278\t      - 28.0%\n279\t      - -2.0pp\n280\t    - - Magnitude-only\n281\t      - 22.0%\n282\t      - -8.0pp\n283\t    - - Random\n284\t      - 5.0%\n285\t      - -25.0pp\n286\t  figures_description:\n287\t  - 'Horizontal bar chart ranking scoring methods by post-prune accuracy. Clear hierarchy:\n288\t    RASP > Gradient ≈ Standard > Magnitude >> Random.'\n289\t  analysis: 'CKA的post-prune marginal contribution仅2pp (vs gradient-only)， Reviewer会质疑是否值得额外的CKA计算开销。Defense需要两个角度：\n290\t    (1) recovery后gap放大（plan_004数据），(2) interaction效应（plan_009）。 Random collapse (5%)提供useful\n291\t    lower bound。 Magnitude-only的劣势支持\"importance metric choice matters\"的general argument。\n292\t\n293\t    '\n294\t- name: CKA-Recoverability Correlation Analysis\n295\t  plan_id: plan_008\n296\t  description: 'Per-structure CKA functional overlap F(h)与recovery后per-structure activation变化的相关性分析。Mixed-effects\n297\t    regression。\n298\t\n299\t    '\n300\t  expected_results:\n301\t    n_mlp_groups_analyzed: 784\n302\t    n_pruned_mlp_groups: 200\n303\t    cka_beta_coefficient: 0.18\n304\t    cka_beta_p_value: 0.02\n305\t    cka_incremental_r2: 0.08\n306\t    full_model_r2: 0.34\n307\t    weight_norm_beta_p: 0.001\n308\t    gradient_importance_beta_p: 0.008\n309\t    activation_magnitude_beta_p: 0.04\n310\t    cka_weight_norm_correlation: 0.42\n311\t    vif_cka: 2.1\n312\t    layer_random_effect_variance: 0.06\n313\t  result_rationale: 'Median档定义CKA beta p在[0.005, 0.05]，incremental R²在[0.05, 0.12]。\n314\t    取p=0.02, incremental R²=8%。CKA显著但effect size中等。 关键nuance：weight norm (r=0.42 with\n315\t    CKA)也是significant predictor (p=0.001)， incremental R²比CKA高。VIF=2.1说明共线性moderate但未达alarming\n316\t    levels (>5)。 这意味着CKA captures some unique variance (8%)但大部分recoverability 被simpler\n317\t    metrics解释。Layer random effect variance=0.06说明层间差异存在 但不dominant。Full model R²=0.34意味着66%的方差unexplained——\n318\t    recoverability是complex多因素决定的。 Claim 2必须弱化为\"additional predictive signal\"而非\"stronger\n319\t    predictor\"。\n320\t\n321\t    '\n322\t  tables:\n323\t  - name: 'Table 5: Mixed-Effects Regression (MLP Groups, N=784)'\n324\t    columns:\n325\t    - Predictor\n326\t    - β\n327\t    - SE\n328\t    - p\n329\t    - Incremental R²\n330\t    rows:\n331\t    - - Weight Norm\n332\t      - 0.31\n333\t      - 0.06\n334\t      - <0.001\n335\t      - 14%\n336\t    - - Gradient Importance\n337\t      - 0.22\n338\t      - 0.07\n339\t      - '0.008'\n340\t      - 11%\n341\t    - - Activation Magnitude\n342\t      - 0.12\n343\t      - 0.06\n344\t      - '0.04'\n345\t      - 5%\n346\t    - - CKA F(h)\n347\t      - 0.18\n348\t      - 0.07\n349\t      - '0.02'\n350\t      - 8%\n351\t    - - Layer (random)\n352\t      - —\n353\t      - —\n354\t      - —\n355\t      - σ²=0.06\n356\t    - - Full Model\n357\t      - —\n358\t      - —\n359\t      - —\n360\t      - R²=0.34\n361\t  figures_description:\n362\t  - 'Scatter plot: per-MLP-group F(h) vs recovery accuracy retention, color-coded\n363\t    by layer. Trend visible but noisy. Partial regression plot after controlling for\n364\t    covariates.'\n365\t  - Forest plot showing standardized β coefficients with 95% CI for all predictors.\n366\t  analysis: 'CKA provides statistically significant but modest additional signal。\n367\t    Weight norm和gradient importance是stronger individual predictors。 共线性(r=0.42)意味着CKA部分captures与weight\n368\t    norm相同的information。 论文中需要honest presentation：CKA is not the strongest predictor，\n369\t    但它captures unique variance不被其他metrics覆盖。 这支持\"CKA as complementary signal\"的framing而非\"CKA\n370\t    as superior metric\"。\n371\t\n372\t    '\n373\t- name: SFT-Only Recovery Comparison\n374\t  plan_id: plan_009\n375\t  description: 'Same pruned models (RASP_20, Standard_20)，same data budget， SFT-only\n376\t    recovery（no GRPO）。测试recovery method是否改变optimal pruning order。\n377\t\n378\t    '\n379\t  expected_results:\n380\t    sft_only_rasp_gsm8k_1319: 0.57\n381\t    sft_only_standard_gsm8k_1319: 0.64\n382\t    sft_standard_advantage_pp: 7\n383\t    sft_standard_vs_grpo_standard: +5pp\n384\t    sft_rasp_vs_grpo_rasp: -7pp\n385\t    interaction_effect_2x2_anova_p: 0.008\n386\t    interaction_effect_size_eta2: 0.12\n387\t  result_rationale: '这是median档最强claim的支撑实验。已有N=100数据：sft_rasp_20=57%， sft_standard_20=64%。N=1319预期保持这个pattern。\n388\t    SFT下Standard优于RASP 7pp——方向与GRPO完全相反（GRPO下RASP优5pp）。 交叉效应显著(p=0.008)：pruning method\n389\t    × recovery method interaction 在2×2 ANOVA中eta²=0.12（medium effect size）。 机制解释：SFT通过teacher-forcing扩展correct\n390\t    paths——Standard保留的 high-importance结构更适合supervised signal的gradient flow。 GRPO通过reward\n391\t    signal压缩incorrect paths——RASP保留的functionally unique 结构更好地维持了RLVR exploration的diversity。\n392\t    这个crossover是genuinely novel的发现，且mechanistically interpretable。\n393\t\n394\t    '\n395\t  tables:\n396\t  - name: 'Table 6: Pruning × Recovery Interaction'\n397\t    columns:\n398\t    - Pruning\n399\t    - SFT-Only\n400\t    - GRPO\n401\t    - Δ (GRPO - SFT)\n402\t    rows:\n403\t    - - RASP_20\n404\t      - 57.0%\n405\t      - 64.0%\n406\t      - +7.0pp\n407\t    - - Standard_20\n408\t      - 64.0%\n409\t      - 59.0%\n410\t      - -5.0pp\n411\t    - - Δ (RASP - Standard)\n412\t      - -7.0pp\n413\t      - +5.0pp\n414\t      - 'Interaction: 12pp'\n415\t  - name: 2×2 ANOVA Results\n416\t    columns:\n417\t    - Source\n418\t    - F\n419\t    - p\n420\t    - η²\n421\t    rows:\n422\t    - - Pruning Method\n423\t      - 1.2\n424\t      - 0.28\n425\t      - 0.02\n426\t    - - Recovery Method\n427\t      - 0.8\n428\t      - 0.38\n429\t      - 0.01\n430\t    - - Pruning × Recovery\n431\t      - 8.4\n432\t      - 0.008\n433\t      - 0.12\n434\t  figures_description:\n435\t  - 'Interaction plot (line chart): x-axis = Recovery Method (SFT, GRPO), y-axis =\n436\t    GSM8K accuracy, two lines (RASP, Standard) crossing. Classic disordinal interaction\n437\t    pattern.'\n438\t  analysis: '这是整篇paper在median档下最clean的result。交叉效应12pp且p<0.01。 ANOVA显示main effects均不显著——pruning\n439\t    method和recovery method 各自不决定accuracy，但interaction dominates。 这直接支持Claim 3：\"recovery\n440\t    method conditions optimal pruning order\"。 Narrative pivot到interaction作为核心贡献完全justified。\n441\t    需要注意：这个ANOVA是在N=1319的single eval上做的， 严格来说需要multi-seed validation。但effect size足够大(12pp)\n442\t    使reviewer likely接受。\n443\t\n444\t    '\n445\t- name: 25% Sparsity RASP + Standard Pipeline\n446\t  plan_id: plan_010\n447\t  description: '25% sparsity下的完整pipeline：RASP和Standard prune → eval → SFT → GRPO。\n448\t    测试sparsity level robustness。\n449\t\n450\t    '\n451\t  expected_results:\n452\t    rasp_25_postprune_gsm8k: 0.18\n453\t    standard_25_postprune_gsm8k: 0.14\n454\t    rasp_25_postprune_gap_pp: 4\n455\t    rasp_25_post_sft_gsm8k: 0.48\n456\t    standard_25_post_sft_gsm8k: 0.55\n457\t    rasp_25_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.55\n458\t    standard_25_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.48\n459\t    grpo_recovery_gap_25_pp: 7\n460\t    interaction_maintained: true\n461\t  result_rationale: '25% sparsity移除更多结构，post-prune accuracy进一步下降。 RASP 18% vs Standard\n462\t    14%——gap从3pp扩大到4pp因为更多pruning decisions 意味着CKA signal有更多机会区分functionally redundant\n463\t    vs unique。 Recovery趋势与20%一致但更pronounced：SFT下Standard优7pp (55% vs 48%)， GRPO下RASP优7pp\n464\t    (55% vs 48%)。交互效应维持甚至增强。 GRPO recovery gap从5pp扩大到7pp——在higher sparsity下， 保留functionally\n465\t    unique结构的优势更明显因为GRPO需要更多structural diversity 来maintain exploration。但overall recovery\n466\t    ceiling降低（55% vs 64% at 20%）， 符合\"more pruning = harder recovery\"的general expectation。\n467\t\n468\t    '\n469\t  tables:\n470\t  - name: 'Table 7: 25% Sparsity Pipeline'\n471\t    columns:\n472\t    - Model\n473\t    - Post-Prune\n474\t    - Post-SFT\n475\t    - Post-GRPO\n476\t    rows:\n477\t    - - RASP_25\n478\t      - 18.0%\n479\t      - 48.0%\n480\t      - 55.0%\n481\t    - - Standard_25\n482\t      - 14.0%\n483\t      - 55.0%\n484\t      - 48.0%\n485\t  figures_description:\n486\t  - 'Line chart: x-axis = sparsity (20%, 25%), y-axis = post-GRPO accuracy, two lines\n487\t    (RASP, Standard). RASP advantage widens with sparsity.'\n488\t  analysis: '25%数据强化两个narrative：(1) RASP advantage scales with sparsity， (2) interaction\n489\t    effect is robust across sparsity levels。 但overall recovery降低——55% vs 79% dense\n490\t    = 70% retention， 接近practical utility threshold。这为30% probe设定预期。\n491\t\n492\t    '\n493\t- name: 30% Sparsity Probe (Prune + Eval Only)\n494\t  plan_id: plan_011\n495\t  description: '30% sparsity下仅prune + eval（不做recovery）。 Map sparsity threshold where\n496\t    both methods approach collapse。\n497\t\n498\t    '\n499\t  expected_results:\n500\t    rasp_30_postprune_gsm8k: 0.08\n501\t    standard_30_postprune_gsm8k: 0.03\n502\t    rasp_30_eos_rate: 0.15\n503\t    standard_30_eos_rate: 0.04\n504\t    gap_pp: 5\n505\t    both_near_collapse: true\n506\t  result_rationale: '已有D005实验在35% sparsity显示collapse。30%接近threshold： RASP勉强维持8%（generation部分functional但reasoning严重受损），\n507\t    Standard接近完全collapse (3%)。Gap扩大到5pp但两者都在near-random水平。 EOS rate差异说明RASP保留了basic\n508\t    generation ability而Standard已崩溃。 这个数据点重要性在于showing the trend：20% (30/27) → 25%\n509\t    (18/14) → 30% (8/3)， RASP advantage在pp上持续但两者都approaching zero。 Recovery at 30%可能仍然possible\n510\t    for RASP but infeasible for Standard—— 但不做recovery所以这是speculative。\n511\t\n512\t    '\n513\t  tables:\n514\t  - name: 'Table 8: Sparsity Scaling'\n515\t    columns:\n516\t    - Sparsity\n517\t    - RASP Post-Prune\n518\t    - Standard Post-Prune\n519\t    - Gap (pp)\n520\t    rows:\n521\t    - - 20%\n522\t      - 30.0%\n523\t      - 27.0%\n524\t      - '3'\n525\t    - - 25%\n526\t      - 18.0%\n527\t      - 14.0%\n528\t      - '4'\n529\t    - - 30%\n530\t      - 8.0%\n531\t      - 3.0%\n532\t      - '5'\n533\t  figures_description:\n534\t  - 'Line chart: accuracy vs sparsity for RASP and Standard. Both declining, gap widening\n535\t    in absolute pp but both approaching zero.'\n536\t  analysis: '30%数据展示diminishing returns：虽然RASP gap在pp上扩大， 但两者都approaching collapse。This\n537\t    bounds RASP''s practical applicability to 20-25% sparsity range for this model。\n538\t    对论文有价值：shows the method''s operating range honestly， 不oversell到high sparsity。\n539\t\n540\t    '\n541\t- name: OOD Evaluation (MATH-500, HumanEval, MMLU)\n542\t  plan_id: plan_012\n543\t  description: 'Best recovered config (RASP_20 post-GRPO) 在OOD benchmarks上评估。 Shows\n544\t    recovery generalizes beyond GSM8K。\n545\t\n546\t    '\n547\t  expected_results:\n548\t    rasp_grpo_math500: 0.38\n549\t    standard_grpo_math500: 0.33\n550\t    rasp_grpo_humaneval: 0.42\n551\t    standard_grpo_humaneval: 0.41\n552\t    rasp_grpo_mmlu: 0.55\n553\t    standard_grpo_mmlu: 0.54\n554\t    dense_math500: 0.52\n555\t    dense_humaneval: 0.58\n556\t    dense_mmlu: 0.62\n557\t    math500_rasp_advantage_pp: 5\n558\t    humaneval_rasp_advantage_pp: 1\n559\t    mmlu_rasp_advantage_pp: 1\n560\t  result_rationale: 'Median档定义MATH-500上RASP advantage 0-8pp，HumanEval无差异。 MATH-500上RASP优5pp\n561\t    (38% vs 33%)——MATH-500与GSM8K同domain (math reasoning)， CKA-aware pruning保留的reasoning\n562\t    structures对math reasoning broadly有效。 HumanEval (code)上近乎无差异(1pp)——coding ability依赖不同的structural\n563\t    components， CKA signal对code generation无特异性。MMLU (knowledge)同样无差异—— pruning主要影响reasoning而非factual\n564\t    knowledge retrieval。 Dense model的retention：MATH-500 73% (38/52)，HumanEval 72%\n565\t    (42/58)， MMLU 89% (55/62)。MMLU retention最高因为knowledge更robust to pruning。\n566\t\n567\t    '\n568\t  tables:\n569\t  - name: 'Table 9: OOD Evaluation'\n570\t    columns:\n571\t    - Benchmark\n572\t    - Dense\n573\t    - RASP+GRPO\n574\t    - Standard+GRPO\n575\t    - Δ (pp)\n576\t    rows:\n577\t    - - GSM8K\n578\t      - 79.0%\n579\t      - 64.0%\n580\t      - 59.0%\n581\t      - '+5'\n582\t    - - MATH-500\n583\t      - 52.0%\n584\t      - 38.0%\n585\t      - 33.0%\n586\t      - '+5'\n587\t    - - HumanEval\n588\t      - 58.0%\n589\t      - 42.0%\n590\t      - 41.0%\n591\t      - '+1'\n592\t    - - MMLU\n593\t      - 62.0%\n594\t      - 55.0%\n595\t      - 54.0%\n596\t      - '+1'\n597\t  figures_description:\n598\t  - 'Radar chart or grouped bar: RASP vs Standard across 4 benchmarks. Math-domain\n599\t    advantage clear, non-math negligible.'\n600\t  analysis: 'OOD结果是mixed——这是median档的定义特征。MATH-500优势支持\"reasoning-specific\" narrative但HumanEval/MMLU无差异限制了generalization\n601\t    claim。 论文framing需要careful：CKA-aware pruning preserves math reasoning structures\n602\t    specifically，而非general capabilities。这actually strengthens mechanistic story （CKA\n603\t    signal captures reasoning-specific redundancy），但limits practical impact。\n604\t\n605\t    '\n606\t- name: Bonsai Baseline 20% Sparsity\n607\t  plan_id: plan_013\n608\t  description: 'Bonsai (ICML 2025) gradient-free structured pruning baseline。 Lower\n609\t    priority than GRASPrune。\n610\t\n611\t    '\n612\t  expected_results:\n613\t    bonsai_20_postprune_gsm8k: 0.2\n614\t    bonsai_20_post_sft_gsm8k: 0.52\n615\t    bonsai_20_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.5\n616\t  result_rationale: 'Bonsai是gradient-free方法，与magnitude-only类似但有structural constraints。\n617\t    Post-prune 20%——低于RASP (30%)和Standard (27%)但高于GRASPrune (8%)。 Gradient-free意味着它not\n618\t    as targeted但also avoids gradient noise。 Recovery到50%——低于RASP (64%)和Standard (59%)。\n619\t    在median档下Bonsai提供another data point但不改变main narrative。 其主要价值是showing that even\n620\t    simple methods achieve reasonable recovery， reinforcing \"GRPO is broadly effective\"\n621\t    message。\n622\t\n623\t    '\n624\t  tables: []\n625\t  figures_description:\n626\t  - Added to Table 2 as additional row.\n627\t  analysis: 'Bonsai是completeness baseline。不改变ranking或narrative。 如果space tight可以放appendix。\n628\t\n629\t    '\n630\t- name: CKA Reliability Analysis\n631\t  plan_id: plan_014\n632\t  description: 'Split-half consistency和calibration size sensitivity。 验证CKA-based scoring的稳定性。\n633\t\n634\t    '\n635\t  expected_results:\n636\t    split_half_spearman_rho: 0.91\n637\t    cal_256_vs_512_rank_corr: 0.93\n638\t    cal_512_vs_1024_rank_corr: 0.97\n639\t    cal_256_accuracy_delta_vs_1024: -0.01\n640\t    cka_compute_time_256: 8min\n641\t    cka_compute_time_512: 15min\n642\t    cka_compute_time_1024: 28min\n643\t  result_rationale: 'CKA基于kernel method，inherently对sample size robust。 Split-half\n644\t    ρ=0.91 > 0.9 threshold说明scoring是reproducible。 256 vs 1024 samples导致accuracy仅差1pp——说明256\n645\t    samples足够 获得near-optimal pruning decision。这支持practical applicability （CKA computation\n646\t    cost可控）。Cal 512→1024的marginal gain minimal (ρ=0.97)， 说明diminishing returns。Compute\n647\t    time与sample size近线性。 Median档下这些数字都\"okay but not impressive\"——ρ=0.91不是0.98， 有些noise在CKA\n648\t    estimation中。\n649\t\n650\t    '\n651\t  tables:\n652\t  - name: 'Table 10: CKA Stability'\n653\t    columns:\n654\t    - Calibration Size\n655\t    - Rank Corr vs 1024\n656\t    - Post-Prune Acc\n657\t    - Compute Time\n658\t    rows:\n659\t    - - 256\n660\t      - 0.93\n661\t      - 29.0%\n662\t      - 8 min\n663\t    - - 512\n664\t      - 0.97\n665\t      - 30.0%\n666\t      - 15 min\n667\t    - - 1024\n668\t      - 1.00 (ref)\n669\t      - 30.0%\n670\t      - 28 min\n671\t  figures_description:\n672\t  - 'Line chart: calibration size vs rank correlation. Plateau after 512.'\n673\t  analysis: 'CKA scoring是stable enough for practical use。256 samples提供 reasonable\n674\t    trade-off（8min compute, 93% rank preservation）。 这addresses reviewer concern about\n675\t    CKA overhead。\n676\t\n677\t    '\n678\t- name: α Sensitivity Ablation\n679\t  plan_id: plan_015\n680\t  description: 'Sweep α ∈ {0, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2, 4} in S(h)=I(h)×(1-F(h))^α at 20% sparsity。\n681\t    Post-prune GSM8K eval for each。\n682\t\n683\t    '\n684\t  expected_results:\n685\t    alpha_0_gsm8k: 0.27\n686\t    alpha_0p25_gsm8k: 0.28\n687\t    alpha_0p5_gsm8k: 0.29\n688\t    alpha_1p0_gsm8k: 0.3\n689\t    alpha_2p0_gsm8k: 0.34\n690\t    alpha_4p0_gsm8k: 0.4\n691\t    optimal_alpha: 4.0\n692\t    optimal_vs_alpha0_gap_pp: 13\n693\t    curve_shape: monotonically increasing but noisy\n694\t    alpha_1_vs_optimal_gap_pp: 10\n695\t    seed_sensitivity_at_optimal: ±3pp across 3 seeds\n696\t  result_rationale: '已有初步数据：alpha_ablation_westd_cal256显示α=4.0给出40% accuracy (highest)。\n697\t    α=0等价于importance-only (Standard)，预期27%——与Standard结果一致。 α从0到4单调递增说明CKA signal consistently有益。但median档的nuance：\n698\t    曲线噪声较多——α=0.25和α=0.5之间差异仅1pp，可能在noise range内。 Optimal α=4.0远高于default α=1——说明CKA\n699\t    signal应该被more heavily weighted， current RASP default (α=1)是suboptimal。13pp gap\n700\t    (α=0 vs α=4)比 median档定义的5-10pp范围更大——但这与已有实验数据一致(40% vs 27%)。 Seed sensitivity\n701\t    ±3pp at α=4说明optimal point不完全stable—— 某些seed下α=2可能更好。这limits the precision of\n702\t    α recommendation。\n703\t\n704\t    '\n705\t  tables:\n706\t  - name: 'Table 11: α Ablation'\n707\t    columns:\n708\t    - α\n709\t    - Post-Prune GSM8K\n710\t    - vs α=0 Δ\n711\t    rows:\n712\t    - - 0 (importance-only)\n713\t      - 27.0%\n714\t      - —\n715\t    - - 0.25\n716\t      - 28.0%\n717\t      - +1pp\n718\t    - - 0.5\n719\t      - 29.0%\n720\t      - +2pp\n721\t    - - 1.0\n722\t      - 30.0%\n723\t      - +3pp\n724\t    - - 2.0\n725\t      - 34.0%\n726\t      - +7pp\n727\t    - - 4.0\n728\t      - 40.0%\n729\t      - +13pp\n730\t  figures_description:\n731\t  - 'Line chart: α vs post-prune accuracy with error bands (3 seeds). Monotonically\n732\t    increasing but wide error bands at higher α.'\n733\t  - 'Heatmap: α × seed → accuracy. Shows seed-dependent optimal.'\n734\t  analysis: 'α ablation是second practical contribution。Key findings： (1) CKA signal\n735\t    consistently helps (monotonic improvement with α)， (2) default α=1 is suboptimal,\n736\t    α≈2-4 better， (3) but optimal α is seed-sensitive。 这suggests adaptive α selection\n737\t    as future work。 对Claim 1的影响：RASP with α=4 achieves 40% post-prune (vs Standard\n738\t    27%)—— gap扩大到13pp，比α=1的3pp gap大得多。如果用optimal α，Claim 1显著增强。 但需要honest discussion\n739\t    of seed sensitivity和overfitting risk （α是在post-prune accuracy上tuned的，可能不generalize\n740\t    to recovery）。\n741\t\n742\t    '\n743\t- name: Inference Speedup Benchmark\n744\t  plan_id: plan_016\n745\t  description: 'Wall-clock latency + throughput对比：dense、RASP_20、Standard_20。 Structured\n746\t    pruning的practical motivation需要efficiency evidence。\n747\t\n748\t    '\n749\t  expected_results:\n750\t    dense_latency_ms_per_token: 28.5\n751\t    rasp_20_latency_ms_per_token: 23.8\n752\t    standard_20_latency_ms_per_token: 23.5\n753\t    dense_throughput_tokens_per_sec: 35.1\n754\t    rasp_20_throughput_tokens_per_sec: 42.0\n755\t    standard_20_throughput_tokens_per_sec: 42.6\n756\t    rasp_speedup_ratio: 1.2\n757\t    standard_speedup_ratio: 1.21\n758\t    rasp_vs_standard_speedup_diff: negligible\n759\t    batch_size_tested:\n760\t    - 1\n761\t    - 4\n762\t    - 8\n763\t    speedup_at_batch_8: 1.18\n764\t  result_rationale: 'Median档定义speedup ratio在[1.15, 1.25]。取1.20x for RASP。 20% structured\n765\t    sparsity移除20% MLP channel groups——理论speedup上限 接近1.25x (MLP占total compute ~67%，移除20%\n766\t    MLP ≈ 13% total reduction)。 实际1.20x低于理论上限因为：(1) attention compute不变， (2) memory\n767\t    bandwidth bottleneck at small batch sizes， (3) kernel launch overhead不随width减少。\n768\t    RASP和Standard speedup几乎相同(1.20 vs 1.21)——两者移除相同数量的结构， 只是选择了不同的结构。Pruning method不影响inference\n769\t    speed。 Batch size 8时speedup略降(1.18x)——更compute-bound时 width reduction的relative\n770\t    benefit减少。\n771\t\n772\t    '\n773\t  tables:\n774\t  - name: 'Table 12: Inference Efficiency'\n775\t    columns:\n776\t    - Model\n777\t    - Latency (ms/token)\n778\t    - Speedup\n779\t    - Throughput (tok/s)\n780\t    rows:\n781\t    - - Dense\n782\t      - 28.5\n783\t      - 1.00×\n784\t      - 35.1\n785\t    - - RASP_20\n786\t      - 23.8\n787\t      - 1.20×\n788\t      - 42.0\n789\t    - - Standard_20\n790\t      - 23.5\n791\t      - 1.21×\n792\t      - 42.6\n793\t  figures_description:\n794\t  - 'Bar chart: latency comparison at batch sizes 1, 4, 8.'\n795\t  analysis: '1.20x speedup是modest但real。对于reasoning model的long generation (often 500-2000\n796\t    tokens)，累积time saving significant。 RASP和Standard speedup差异negligible——这是好消息（RASP没有efficiency\n797\t    cost） 也是expected（same sparsity level）。 论文中作为practical motivation section的supporting\n798\t    data。\n799\t\n800\t    '\n801\t- name: Unstructured Pruning Baseline 20%\n802\t  plan_id: plan_017\n803\t  description: '20% unstructured (magnitude-based) pruning baseline。 Calibrate structured\n804\t    vs unstructured gap。\n805\t\n806\t    '\n807\t  expected_results:\n808\t    unstructured_20_postprune_gsm8k: 0.68\n809\t    unstructured_20_post_sft_gsm8k: 0.7\n810\t    unstructured_20_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.62\n811\t    unstructured_20_speedup_ratio: 1.0\n812\t    unstructured_vs_dense_retention_postprune: 0.86\n813\t    unstructured_vs_rasp_structured_postprune_gap: 38\n814\t  result_rationale: 'Unstructured 20% pruning保留much more accuracy post-prune (68%\n815\t    vs 30% RASP) 因为individual weight zeroing far less disruptive than removing entire\n816\t    channel groups。 Post-SFT仅微增到70%（already high baseline）。 Post-GRPO actually slightly\n817\t    lower (62%)——可能因为sparse weights的gradient flow 不如dense结构适合RLVR的exploration-exploitation\n818\t    dynamics。 关键：unstructured pruning无法获得real speedup (1.0x)因为sparse operations 在standard\n819\t    GPU hardware上不加速。这justifies structured pruning research。 Median档预期post_grpo 0.58-0.66，取0.62。\n820\t    GRPO对unstructured model的recovery有限因为post-prune accuracy已经high (68%)， \"ceiling\n821\t    effect\"限制了further improvement，且部分accuracy可能lost to GRPO''s exploration noise on\n822\t    already-functional model。\n823\t\n824\t    '\n825\t  tables:\n826\t  - name: 'Table 13: Structured vs Unstructured'\n827\t    columns:\n828\t    - Method\n829\t    - Type\n830\t    - Post-Prune\n831\t    - Post-GRPO\n832\t    - Speedup\n833\t    rows:\n834\t    - - RASP_20\n835\t      - Structured\n836\t      - 30.0%\n837\t      - 64.0%\n838\t      - 1.20×\n839\t    - - Standard_20\n840\t      - Structured\n841\t      - 27.0%\n842\t      - 59.0%\n843\t      - 1.21×\n844\t    - - Magnitude_20\n845\t      - Unstructured\n846\t      - 68.0%\n847\t      - 62.0%\n848\t      - 1.00×\n849\t  figures_description:\n850\t  - 'Scatter plot: post-prune accuracy vs inference speedup for all methods. Unstructured\n851\t    top-left (high acc, no speedup), structured bottom-right (lower acc, speedup).'\n852\t  analysis: 'Unstructured baseline frames the paper''s contribution： structured pruning\n853\t    trades post-prune accuracy for real speedup， 但needs intelligent structure selection\n854\t    (RASP) and RLVR recovery (GRPO) to close the accuracy gap。RASP+GRPO (64%) approaches\n855\t    unstructured (62%) while delivering 1.20x speedup——this is the practical value\n856\t    proposition。 Interesting：RASP+GRPO actually slightly beats unstructured+GRPO (64%\n857\t    vs 62%)。 这可能是noise但也可能说明structured pruning creates better GRPO training dynamics。\n858\t\n859\t    '\n860\t- name: SFT OOD Eval Contingency\n861\t  plan_id: plan_018\n862\t  description: 'SFT-recovered Standard model (64% GSM8K) 在MATH-500和HumanEval上评估。 Check\n863\t    if 1%→64% SFT jump is genuine reasoning recovery vs GSM8K memorization。\n864\t\n865\t    '\n866\t  expected_results:\n867\t    sft_standard_math500: 0.3\n868\t    sft_standard_humaneval: 0.35\n869\t    sft_standard_gsm8k_ref: 0.64\n870\t    sft_rasp_math500: 0.28\n871\t    sft_rasp_humaneval: 0.33\n872\t    sft_rasp_gsm8k_ref: 0.57\n873\t    dense_math500_ref: 0.52\n874\t    dense_humaneval_ref: 0.58\n875\t    math500_retention_standard_sft: 0.58\n876\t    humaneval_retention_standard_sft: 0.6\n877\t  result_rationale: 'Standard SFT 64% GSM8K的1%→64%跳跃确实suspicious——但SFT是supervised\n878\t    training， 能够快速恢复format和basic arithmetic。MATH-500上30% (vs dense 52%) 说明SFT recovery是genuine但partial——不仅是GSM8K\n879\t    pattern memorization， 因为MATH-500难度更高，30%仍代表real reasoning能力（random baseline ~5%）。\n880\t    HumanEval 35%同样说明generalized recovery。 关键comparison：SFT-Standard MATH-500 (30%)\n881\t    vs GRPO-RASP MATH-500 (38%)—— GRPO recovery在OOD上更robust，支持\"RLVR enables deeper\n882\t    recovery\"的argument。 但SFT-Standard > SFT-RASP on MATH-500 (30% vs 28%)—— SFT recovery\n883\t    maintain Standard''s advantage even OOD。Interaction story holds。\n884\t\n885\t    '\n886\t  tables:\n887\t  - name: 'Table 14: SFT Recovery OOD Check'\n888\t    columns:\n889\t    - Model\n890\t    - GSM8K\n891\t    - MATH-500\n892\t    - HumanEval\n893\t    rows:\n894\t    - - Dense\n895\t      - 79.0%\n896\t      - 52.0%\n897\t      - 58.0%\n898\t    - - SFT-Standard\n899\t      - 64.0%\n900\t      - 30.0%\n901\t      - 35.0%\n902\t    - - SFT-RASP\n903\t      - 57.0%\n904\t      - 28.0%\n905\t      - 33.0%\n906\t    - - GRPO-RASP\n907\t      - 64.0%\n908\t      - 38.0%\n909\t      - 42.0%\n910\t    - - GRPO-Standard\n911\t      - 59.0%\n912\t      - 33.0%\n913\t      - 41.0%\n914\t  figures_description:\n915\t  - 'Grouped bar: GSM8K vs MATH-500 vs HumanEval retention rates for each recovery\n916\t    condition.'\n917\t  analysis: SFT recovery不是memorization——OOD performance confirms genuine recovery。\n918\t    但GRPO recovery consistently delivers higher OOD retention， especially on MATH-500\n919\t    (38% vs 30% for best SFT)。 This adds to Claim 3：GRPO不仅在GSM8K上favor RASP， 在OOD上也delivers\n920\t    deeper、more generalizable recovery。\n921\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jx1jirUJ8DukLEsTetRwWZ","session_id":"338b77c3-ab77-4d20-989d-1a060abc37a8","uuid":"eeb845cb-bc31-4fc1-9376-1b11cb646aa6","timestamp":"2026-05-15T15:07:03.058Z"}
